# StudioDesk backend

Canon wins. Rules: `studio-desk-docs/04-engineering-rules/backend.md`. Architecture: `studio-desk-docs/03-architecture/`.

- Main branch: `development`. A push to `development` deploys after green tests.
- Commands, with the exact scripts in `README.md`: `pnpm test`, `pnpm test:e2e`, `pnpm db:up`, `pnpm db:down`, `pnpm db:reset`, `pnpm db:generate`, `pnpm db:migrate`, `pnpm start:dev`.
- The PostgreSQL login of the organization API is `studio_api` (`src/database/expected-grants.ts`). Grants use that name.
